    "text": "By Paige Wuthrich ,\n1 days ago A suspect in an alleged kidnapping attempt in Clark County received more than he bargained for when an 11-year-old girl kicked him in the groin and fled. According to court documents, Jerson Hartman, 31, of Twin Falls, Idaho, was wearing a ski mask when he reportedly attempted to seize the girl at 5:30 p.m. on December 15 in a Vancouver residential neighborhood. The girl kicked him in the groin and sprinted away. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
